       DATA DIVISION.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           SET     WS-VIEW                       TO    "D"

           *> SHOW-VIEW: switches the page shown under the header: the dashboard (PG-DASH) or the
           *> Dados page.
           *> Uses:   WS-VIEW = "D" (the dashboard), set just above.
           *> Result: layer Dados hidden and PG-DASH shown; BTN-DASH gets BackgroundColor "#3E7BE8"
           *>         and ForegroundColor "#FFFFFF", BTN-DATA white ("#FFFFFF") with text "#1B2A4E".

           CALL    "SHOW-VIEW"
]]></Event>
